 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 2.2,
   "end": 7.422,
   "text": "They landed on the other side. Tombs. Chains. And screaming in the dark.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 7.922,
   "end": 11.762,
   "text": "A man lived among the graves. No chain could hold him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 12.162,
   "end": 15.535,
   "text": "When he saw Jesus, he ran, and fell at his feet.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 15.835,
   "end": 19.496,
   "text": "What do you want with me, Jesus, Son of the Most High God?",
   "tempter": true
  },
  {
   "start": 19.996,
   "end": 21.216,
   "text": "What is your name?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 21.816,
   "end": 24.645,
   "text": "My name is Legion. For we are many.",
   "tempter": true
  },
  {
   "start": 25.445,
   "end": 28.428,
   "text": "On the hill, a great herd of pigs was feeding.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 28.628,
   "end": 30.552,
   "text": "Send us into the pigs.",
   "tempter": true
  },
  {
   "start": 31.052,
   "end": 35.451,
   "text": "He let them go. The whole herd rushed down the cliff, into the sea.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 36.651,
   "end": 42.159,
   "text": "The town came running, and found the man sitting there, dressed, and in his right mind.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 42.559,
   "end": 45.828,
   "text": "They were afraid. And they begged Jesus to leave.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 46.328,
   "end": 47.799,
   "text": "Let me come with you.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 48.299,
   "end": 51.638,
   "text": "Go home. Tell them how much the Lord has done for you.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 52.538,
   "end": 55.816,
   "text": "Follow for part eight.",
   "tempter": false
  }
 ]
}